@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+Feature: Production Code Coverage
+  Shipshape harbour inspection findings for the production codebase.
+  Captain-tagged skeletons are derived from code inspection, not product intent.
+  Captain MUST verify each with the user before promoting.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Dead code commitEdit function should be removed
+    Given the application source at "js/app.js"
+    When I scan the source for the function "commitEdit"
+    Then the function is defined but never called in the codebase
+    And the function is a duplicate of "commitEditDelegate"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Production code coverage gap through eval-based loading
+    Given the application source at "js/app.js"
+    When I run the coverage tool
+    Then the production code shows 0% coverage because it loads via window.eval in happy-dom
+    And the step definitions exercise the code through DOM interaction only
\ No newline at end of file
